<title>JAPAN: Japan must closely watch forex movements -- EPA.</title>
<headline>Japan must closely watch forex movements -- EPA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recent foreign exchange movements have been very sharp and it is important to keep a close watch on further developments, Economic Planning Agency (EPA) Minister Taro Aso told a news conference on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He added that foreign exchange rates should reflect economic fundamentals.</p>
</text>
